ontrol all sound that I hear. That little 110% boost option some have is handy when intoning vowels for meditation, as well. It&#x27;s just loud enough to vibrate the central… <a href=\"https://x.com/gunsnrosesgirl3/status/1742267713244823552\">Tweet by @gunsnrosesgirl3</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/gunsnrosesgirl3/status/1742267713244823552\">https://x.com/gunsnrosesgirl3/status/1742267713244823552</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1742289804782371039</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1742289804782371039\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-02T21:00:34Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1742291666298437872":{"a":"<p>I&#x27;ve seen these for $18 in Walmart at times. Absolutely outstanding. There is a more expensive version with awareness mode so you can toggle the outside world on and off. <br>\n<a href=\"https://www.jlab.com/products/go-air-pop-true-wireless-earbuds\">jlab.com/products/go-ai…</a> t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1742291666298437872-GC3dCUxXUAEhgxT.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1742291666298437872</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1742291666298437872\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-02T21:07:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1742292160320258312":{"a":"<p>There are layers to what you are hearing. You are aware of people talking and sudden loud noises and maybe some specific repetitive noise. What you are not aware of is probably keeping you on the edge of anger at all times. Just put in some earplugs and see if you feel better.…</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1742292160320258312</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1742292160320258312\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-02T21